2026-05-28 12:06:12,041 | DEBUG | anthropic._base_client | Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-0ef2c2b2-1ae1-4f9e-b0d2-5b45f3577f69', 'content': None, 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 8192, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'text', 'text': 'Requirement (natural language):\nImplement a producer-consumer system with three components:\n\n  1. A bounded FIFO queue of capacity 3. Items are positive integers in\n     1..10. Enqueue is rejected when the queue is full; dequeue is rejected\n     when the queue is empty.\n  2. A producer that generates items 1..3 in order and enqueues them.\n  3. A consumer that dequeues items and tracks the running sum.\n\nSafety properties:\n  - The queue length is always in 0..3.\n  - No item is ever lost: every item produced is eventually consumed in\n    FIFO order (i.e. consumer.received is a prefix of producer.generated).\n  - The producer never produces beyond item 3.\n\nApproved decomposition plan:\nParent: ProducerConsumerSystem\nParent role: Composes the bounded FIFO queue with a producer and consumer, wiring enqueue/dequeue across components and asserting global safety: queue length in 0..3, consumer.received is a FIFO prefix of producer.generated, and producer never exceeds item 3.\n\nChild modules:\n  - BoundedQueue: Bounded FIFO queue of capacity 3 holding integers in 1..10; rejects enqueue when full and dequeue when empty.\n      state_variables: buffer\n      actions: Enqueue, Dequeue\n      invariant_sketch: Buffer length is always between 0 and capacity 3, and every stored item is in 1..10.\n  - Producer: Generates the sequence of items 1, 2, 3 in order and offers each to the queue; stops after item 3.\n      state_variables: generated, next_item\n      actions: Produce\n      invariant_sketch: generated is a prefix of <<1,2,3>> and next_item never exceeds 4.\n  - Consumer: Dequeues items from the queue, appends them to a received log, and maintains a running sum.\n      state_variables: received, sum\n      actions: Consume\n      invariant_sketch: sum equals the arithmetic sum of received, and received contains only items in 1..10.\n\nExpand this plan into a ModuleBundle. For each child, emit both <Name>_Abs (pure TLA+) and <Name>_Impl (PlusCal-bearing TLA+). Emit a parent module that INSTANCEs each impl and defines its own composed Inv and Property. Pin small finite CONSTANTS so TLC can model-check exhaustively. Emit one call to propose_module_bundle.'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01QjJaysscE999NLGThVttM4', 'name': 'propose_module_bundle', 'input': {'slug': 'producer_consumer_system', 'parent': {'name': 'ProducerConsumerSystem', 'invariant_name': 'Inv', 'property_name': 'Property', 'tla_source': '---- MODULE ProducerConsumerSystem ----\nEXTENDS Naturals, Sequences\n\nCONSTANTS Capacity, MaxItem\n\nVARIABLES buffer, generated, next_item, received, sum, pcQ, pcP, pcC\n\nQ == INSTANCE BoundedQueue_Impl WITH buffer <- buffer, Capacity <- Capacity, pc <- pcQ\nP == INSTANCE Producer_Impl WITH generated <- generated, next_item <- next_item, MaxItem <- MaxItem, pc <- pcP\nC == INSTANCE Consumer_Impl WITH received <- received, sum <- sum, pc <- pcC\n\nSpec == Q!Spec /\\ P!Spec /\\ C!Spec\n\nSumSeq[s \\in Seq(1..10)] ==\n  IF s = << >> THEN 0 ELSE Head(s) + SumSeq[Tail(s)]\n\nIsPrefix(a, b) ==\n  /\\ Len(a) <= Len(b)\n  /\\ \\A i \\in 1..Len(a) : a[i] = b[i]\n\nInv ==\n  /\\ Q!Inv\n  /\\ P!Inv\n  /\\ C!Inv\n  /\\ Len(buffer) \\in 0..Capacity\n  /\\ IsPrefix(received, generated)\n  /\\ next_item \\in 1..(MaxItem+1)\n  /\\ generated \\in Seq(1..MaxItem)\n  /\\ received \\in Seq(1..MaxItem)\n\nProperty ==\n  /\\ Len(buffer) \\in 0..Capacity\n  /\\ IsPrefix(received, generated)\n  /\\ next_item <= MaxItem + 1\n\n====\n'}, 'modules': [{'name': 'BoundedQueue', 'role': 'abs', 'tla_source': "---- MODULE BoundedQueue_Abs ----\nEXTENDS Naturals, Sequences\n\nCONSTANT Capacity\n\nVARIABLE queue\n\nvars == << queue >>\n\nInit == queue = << >>\n\nEnqueue(v) ==\n  /\\ v \\in 1..10\n  /\\ Len(queue) < Capacity\n  /\\ queue' = Append(queue, v)\n\nDequeue ==\n  /\\ Len(queue) > 0\n  /\\ queue' = Tail(queue)\n\nNext == (\\E v \\in 1..10 : Enqueue(v)) \\/ Dequeue\n\nSpec == Init /\\ [][Next]_vars\n\nInv ==\n  /\\ Len(queue) \\in 0..Capacity\n  /\\ \\A i \\in 1..Len(queue) : queue[i] \\in 1..10\n\n====\n"}, {'name': 'BoundedQueue', 'role': 'impl', 'abstraction_map': {'queue': 'buffer'}, 'tla_source': '---- MODULE BoundedQueue_Impl ----\nEXTENDS Naturals, Sequences\n\nCONSTANT Capacity\n\n(* --algorithm BoundedQueue\nvariables buffer = << >>;\nbegin\n  Loop:\n    while TRUE do\n      either\n        with v \\in 1..10 do\n          await Len(buffer) < Capacity;\n          buffer := Append(buffer, v);\n        end with;\n      or\n        await Len(buffer) > 0;\n        buffer := Tail(buffer);\n      end either;\n    end while;\n  Finish:\n    skip;\nend algorithm; *)\n\nInv ==\n  /\\ Len(buffer) \\in 0..Capacity\n  /\\ \\A i \\in 1..Len(buffer) : buffer[i] \\in 1..10\n  /\\ pc \\in {"Loop", "Finish", "Done"}\n\nProperty == Len(buffer) \\in 0..Capacity\n\n====\n', 'pluscal_source': 'x'}, {'name': 'Producer', 'role': 'abs', 'tla_source': "---- MODULE Producer_Abs ----\nEXTENDS Naturals, Sequences\n\nCONSTANT MaxItem\n\nVARIABLES generated, next_item\n\nvars == << generated, next_item >>\n\nInit ==\n  /\\ generated = << >>\n  /\\ next_item = 1\n\nProduce ==\n  /\\ next_item <= MaxItem\n  /\\ generated' = Append(generated, next_item)\n  /\\ next_item' = next_item + 1\n\nNext == Produce \\/ (next_item > MaxItem /\\ UNCHANGED vars)\n\nSpec == Init /\\ [][Next]_vars\n\nInv ==\n  /\\ next_item \\in 1..(MaxItem+1)\n  /\\ Len(generated) = next_item - 1\n  /\\ \\A i \\in 1..Len(generated) : generated[i] = i\n\n====\n"}, {'name': 'Producer', 'role': 'impl', 'abstraction_map': {'generated':